# Normalize all text to LF in the repo AND on checkout, so the Biome formatter
# (lineEnding: lf) stays consistent across Windows/macOS/Linux regardless of git's
# core.autocrlf. Binary assets are left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.evb binary
*.tgz binary
